# Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill in:   cp .env.example .env
# NEVER commit .env. Never paste the real value into chats, issues, or notes.

# RPC_URL: upstream Arbitrum One (chain id 42161) JSON-RPC endpoint.
#   - Read ONLY by the anvil container, READ-ONLY: anvil lazily fetches accounts,
#     code, and storage slots AT the pinned block (fork.env) as they are touched.
#   - The foundry toolchain container is never given this value; it talks to
#     http://anvil:8545 only.
#   - A freshly pinned block works with any node. To keep an old pin readable after
#     it ages past the node's state retention, the endpoint needs archive access.
#   - scripts/pin-fork-block.sh refuses to pin if the endpoint is not chain 42161.
#   - Shape examples: https://arb-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/<key>
#                     https://<name>.arbitrum-mainnet.quiknode.pro/<token>/
RPC_URL=
